Description:
A simple file-backed proto with an in-memory cache.

Local Modifications:

- patches/000-win-b-mode.patch

  Uses the binary mode when opening files ("rb"/"wb"), as Windows by default
  opens files in text mode.  Without this patch, reading opstats.db was failing
  on Windows and causing EligibilityEvalComputationIOError.
